# Data Domain

## Org vs config

| Organization | Configuration |
|--------------|---------------|
| Company, Department, Team, Employee, Project | Job Role, AI Provider/Model, AI Policy, ROI / task benchmarks |

`users` (auth) ≠ `employees` (business). Link via `user_id`.

## Attribution (required on AI events)

`company_id`, `department_id`, `team_id`, `employee_id`, `project_id`, `task_category`, `provider`, `model`, tokens, cost.

## ROI (MVP)

`business_value ≈ (benchmark_hours) × (job_role.hourly_cost)`  
`estimated_roi = (value - ai_cost) / ai_cost`

Company defines working hours, role rates, and task benchmarks — employees do not.

## Secrets

Never store raw provider API keys in plain columns; use encrypted/secret references.
